00:30:00.430 --> 00:30:02.290
- Yeah. I don't know
what I don't know.

00:30:04.120 --> 00:30:04.360
- Yeah.

00:30:04.360 --> 00:30:09.550
And I know some industry groups
like pharma have their own, like,

00:30:09.550 --> 00:30:13.795
AR in pharma organizations as well
to share things with each other. But

00:30:15.130 --> 00:30:16.090
I think a great

00:30:16.900 --> 00:30:20.920
option too is like meeting
