00:49:07.160 --> 00:49:11.180
it's that proof that
you're actually impacting the bottom

00:49:11.180 --> 00:49:12.300
line of the company.

00:49:12.300 --> 00:49:14.720
And so if you want to
dig a little more into that world,

00:49:14.720 --> 00:49:16.160
I highly recommend
his podcasts.

00:49:17.060 --> 00:49:17.840
They're not--

